WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.400
Here's what done looks like.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:05.875
Every group has a file with an owner and
tests for someone in and someone out.

3
00:00:05.875 --> 00:00:10.025
The pull request check passes, with
its diff in front of the reviewer.

4
00:00:10.025 --> 00:00:15.120
Every rule starts with the two guards,
avoids memberOf and display-name attributes,

5
00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:18.000
and makes a written
decision about empty slots.

6
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.900
The offline evaluator agrees
with Graph's for every test.

7
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:26.437
And the incident runbook takes its record
before pausing and resumes from it.

8
00:00:26.437 --> 00:00:30.863
Next, Chapter 5 builds Lifecycle
Workflows custom extensions.

9
00:00:30.863 --> 00:00:32.020
Thanks for watching.
